      "content": "Consultation closed on Friday. Union has asked for the transfer to be delayed, and honestly Marcus and I think they have a point. Seven of the nine staff have chosen transfer, two want redeployment, but Kestrel can't start training our people on their scripts until the consultation outcome letters are out, which is next week. Kestrel say they need five weeks from that. 1 September isn't achievable without risking the service.",
